    "title": "Rigorous Mathematical Specification, Bilinear Multiplicative Interactions, and Convergence of Gated Linear Units (SwiGLU, GeGLU, ReGLU, GLU)",
    "excerpt": "This document presents the complete mathematical formulation and algorithmic specification of Gated Linear Units (GLUs), focusing on SwiGLU, GeGLU, ReGLU, and classical GLU. In modern large language m...",
    "tex": "../building_blocks/gated_linear_units/math.tex",
