    "title": "Theoretical Foundations, Receptive Field Expansion, and Multi-Scale Context of Dilated (Atrous) Convolution",
    "excerpt": "This document provides the formal mathematical specification, discrete atrous sampling mechanics, and receptive field expansion analysis of Dilated (Atrous) Convolution. In dense prediction tasks such...",
