    "title": "Mathematical Specification, Soft Target Geometry, and Logit Boundedness Proof of Label Smoothing Regularization (ALGO-NN-16)",
    "excerpt": "Standard one-hot targets encourage deep neural networks to produce overconfident logit representations, driving weight norms toward infinity and degrading expected calibration error (ECE). Label Smoot...",
    "tex": "../losses/label_smoothing/math.tex",
