    "algoName": "Qk Norm Logit Soft Capping",
    "title": "Mathematical Foundations, Attention Logit Bounding, and Gradient Saturation Dynamics of QK-Norm and Logit Soft-Capping",
    "excerpt": "This document provides the rigorous mathematical formulation, variance bounding, and numerical stability analysis for Query-Key Normalization (QK-Norm) and Logit Soft-Capping in modern large language ...",
