    "title": "Mathematical Foundations, Lipschitz Bounding, and Power Iteration Dynamics of Spectral and Weight Normalization",
    "excerpt": "This document provides the rigorous mathematical formulation, spectral theory, and algorithmic derivation of Spectral Normalization and Weight Normalization. Spectral Normalization constrains the matr...",
