    "title": "Theoretical Foundations, Expectation Preservation, and Architecture Ensembling of Stochastic Depth (DropPath)",
    "excerpt": "This document provides the rigorous mathematical specification, expectation-invariance proofs, and effective-depth dynamics of Stochastic Depth (DropPath). In extremely deep residual networks and Visi...",
