    "excerpt": "Let _(a | s) denote a stochastic policy parameterized by differentiable weights , defining a probability distribution over discrete or continuous actions a given state s . Let = (s_0, a_0, r_0, , s_T-...",
    "tex": "../reinforcement_learning/policy_gradients_reinforce/math.tex",
