    "excerpt": "Let f(; W): ^D_ ^D_ denote a primary network layer parameterized by weight matrix W ^D_ D_. In classical deep learning, W is fixed after training. A is an auxiliary meta-model _: ^D_ D_ parameterized ...",
    "tex": "../specialized_scientific_meta/hypernetworks_conditioning/math.tex",
