    "excerpt": "Let ^D denote an input feature vector and y denote a continuous continuous target. In classical regression, a neural network minimizes Mean Squared Error (MSE), which implicitly assumes a unimodal Gau...",
    "tex": "../specialized_scientific_meta/mixture_density_networks/math.tex",
