    "title": "#255: Quantization-aware training (QAT)",
    "excerpt": "Training (or fine-tuning) with simulated quantization in the forward pass, so the model learns weights that stay accurate after quantization.",
    "tex": "../quantization/quantization_aware_training/math.tex",
