    "title": "#272: Grad-CAM (class activation mapping)",
    "excerpt": "A coarse heatmap showing which regions of an image a CNN used for a given class, using gradients flowing into the last convolutional layer.",
    "tex": "../interpretability_explainability/grad_cam/math.tex",
