    "title": "#279: Circuit discovery (automated component tracing)",
    "excerpt": "Identifying the minimal subgraph of model components (attention heads, MLP neurons and their connections) that implements a specific behavior.",
    "tex": "../interpretability_explainability/circuit_discovery/math.tex",
