    "title": "#286: Guard models (input and output safety classifiers)",
    "excerpt": "Separate classifiers that screen model inputs and outputs for policy violations (harmful content, injection attempts, sensitive data) before they're processed or returned.",
    "tex": "../editing_unlearning_security/guard_models/math.tex",
